      <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#555;margin:0 0 16px;">Tell us what the home is doing and we'll come measure it. The visit is free, the estimate is written, and there's no obligation.</p>
      <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#555;margin:0;">In a hurry? Call <a href="tel:+13522473105" style="color:#1F6D5A;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">(352) 247-3105</a> — our line is answered 24/7 for closing and insurance deadlines.</p>
